From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] journal: show visible loading state during refresh

Keep the GTK4 Journal visibly responsive while its asynchronous datastore
query is pending. The existing ready callback replaces this state with rows
or the precise empty/query message.

--- a/src/jarabe/journal/listview.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/journal/listview.py
@@ -483,6 +483,7 @@
             else:
                 self._backup_selected = self._model.get_selected_items()
             self._model.stop()
         self._dirty = False
+        self._show_message(_('Loading Journal…'))
 
         self._model = ListModel(self._query)
